{
  "summary": "The investigation focuses on whether a valid, approved procedure (ECP or temporary instruction) was physically present and understood during boundary preparation at ~10:00 AM when air pressure dropped. The work package cover shows the ECP revision issued but no signed acceptance and a blank field for a temporary instruction; however, physical attachment of an unrecorded document cannot be ruled out by this record alone.",
  "findings": [
    {
      "statement": "At ~10:00 AM, boundary preparation was in progress with maintenance release signature pending on WO-527 work package cover (IA-S02).",
      "type": "finding",
      "status": "supported",
      "sourceIds": [
